# Everything that only matters on hosting the site owns.
#
# The self-update system, the packager and the shipped archives are all about
# replacing files on disk, which a read-only deployment cannot do and does not
# need — a new version arrives here by being deployed. Left out so they are not
# uploaded, and so nothing is tempted to call them.
*.zip
deploy/
storage/
tests/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
